WEBVTT

00:08:59.316 --> 00:09:00.922
as so many of you already do —

00:09:00.922 --> 00:09:03.948
I know that firsthand —

00:09:03.948 --> 00:09:05.770
and to reimagine a world

00:09:05.770 --> 00:09:07.964
where we use our best talents together

00:09:07.964 --> 00:09:11.278
more often to accomplish greater things together

00:09:11.278 --> 00:09:14.994
than we could on our own.

00:09:14.994 --> 00:09:17.304
Just remember,

00:09:17.304 --> 00:09:20.000
as Dave Liniger once said,

00:09:20.000 --> 00:09:22.429
"You can't succeed

00:09:22.429 --> 00:09:25.568
coming to the potluck with only a fork."

00:09:25.568 --> 00:09:27.525
(Laughter)

00:09:27.525 --> 00:09:29.096
Thank you very much.

00:09:29.096 --> 00:09:33.231
Thank you. (Applause)